    'mission/2': 'This is the job description nobody hands you: live the pace yourself, connect your team’s work to the mission, and keep your own manager close.',
    'mission/3': 'Growth is not an abstraction. A colleague in New York or West Palm Beach may need your office tomorrow, and the systems your team runs in Nashville are what the new sites run on.',
    'shift/1': 'The day you became a manager, your job changed from doing the work to being responsible for it. Everything in this course follows from that one shift.',
